<title>FRANCE: Suez says sells IMS stake.</title>
<headline>Suez says sells IMS stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie de Suez unit Suez Industrie said on Tuesday that it sold its 18.4 percent stake in IMS International Metal Service.</p>
<p>Suez Industrie said the sale reduces its holding in IMS to zero from 19 percent at the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>It said the total price received for the stake was about 210 million francs. The company said it made a capital gain on the sale but did not give the amount.</p>
<p>Suez gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
